---
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<section class="contact section" id="contact"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">一起，为成长留一点空间</p><h2>听见自己的回响。<br />找到下一步的<span>方向。</span></h2><p>带着一个具体场景来。<br />我们从那里，开始理解学习。</p><div class="wechat"><span>微信</span><strong>{site.wechat}</strong><button data-copy={site.wechat}>复制微信号</button></div><button class="button button-gold" data-prepare>准备沟通清单 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><small>添加微信时，可以简要说明你希望了解的课程或学习场景。</small><span class="contact-signature" aria-hidden="true">Amy</span></section>
